  m_text: "Now we\u2019re ready to weld these two metal pieces. Normally, you would
    press the foot lever to start the weld \u2014 but in this VR simulation, simply
    tap the Next button.\n\nWhen welding begins, the electrodes apply pressure and
    pass high current through the metal. The heat melts the metal at the contact
    point, and the pieces fuse together to form a strong weld spot."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
